<title>USA: MMI Products Inc sells $120 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>MMI Products Inc sells $120 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement of $120 million in high-yield bond issue from MMI Products Inc was priced on Friday via lead manager Bear Stearns &amp;</p>
<p>Co Inc, market sources said.</p>
<p>MMI, a privately-held company, manufactures building materials for residential and commercial construction.</p>
<p>The deal was increased from an original size of $110 million.</p>
<p>BORROWER MMI PRODUCTS INC</p>
<p>AMT $120 MLN	 COUPON 11.25 PCT  MATURITY 4/15/07</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 10/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 11.25 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD 427 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE FOR</p>
<p>							    FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>NOTES: Three year equity call for 35 percent of the issue at</p>
<p>111.25.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1662))</p>
</text>
